#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_folder.rst:5
msgid "Delete category"
msgstr "删除类别"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_folder.rst:7
msgid "Working with collections can only be done from `collections panel`_."
msgstr "只能从 `收集面板 <collections panel_>`_ 中进行收藏工作。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_folder.rst:11
msgid ""
"Select **Settings > Display > Collections** menu item to display the "
"`collections panel`_."
msgstr "选择 **设置 > 显示 > 收藏** 菜单项以显示 `收藏面板 <collections panel_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_folder.rst:13
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows deleting categories from some collection. The user has "
"only read rights at QET element collection, the user can delete categories "
"from all collections except QET collection."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许删除一些收藏中的类。用户只在QET元素收藏中拥有阅读权限，用户可以删除除QET收藏以外的所有收藏中的类。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_folder.rst:16
msgid ""
"Right click on the category / sub-category from the collection that should "
"be deleted."
msgstr "从收藏中右键单击应删除的类别 / 子类别 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_folder.rst:21
msgid "Figure: Options at folder"
msgstr "图：文件夹中的选项"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_folder.rst:23
msgid ""
"Click the option **Delete folder** to delete the category / sub-category."
msgstr "单击选项 **删除文件夹** 删除类别/子类别 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_folder.rst:24
msgid ""
"A PopUp confirmation window will be displayed, press **OK** to confirm and "
"delete the category / sub-category."
msgstr "将显示一个 PopUp 确认窗口，按 **OK** 确认并删除该类别 / 子类别 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_folder.rst:29
msgid "Figure: Deleting PopUp window confirmation"
msgstr "图：删除弹出窗口确认"

#: ../../source/users/element/collection/delete_folder.rst:33
msgid ""
"Be sure about what should be deleted, the category / sub-category and all "
"elements will be deleted from the collection and file system."
msgstr "请确定应该删除什么，分类 / 子分类和所有元素将从收藏和文件系统中删除 。"
